phosphate stones.

70
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:20,620
Calcium oxalate stones are
more common of these two.

71
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:24,420
and they have many
different causes some of

72
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:27,320
