74
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:34,580
vitamin c is going to be
metabolized into oxalate

75
00:03:36,020 --> 00:03:40,340
hypocitrituria which is low
citrate in the urine and

76
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:44,020
this can be caused by renal
tubular acidosis strenuous

77
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:47,260
