be Crohn's disease, and

88
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:26,780
this increases the risk
of kidney stones because

89
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:30,140
when fat is available, so
if we have malabsorption

90
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:33,890
of fat, we have more fat
