urinary volume.

134
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:13,180
And uric acid stones
can also be caused by

135
00:07:13,230 --> 00:07:16,940
hyperuricoseuria or increased
uric acid in the urine.

136
00:07:17,380 --> 00:07:20,590
So uric acid stones have
