141
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:39,400
levels in the urine,
resulting in stone formation.

142
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:44,080
Uric acid stones are
radiolucent on x-ray, which

143
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:46,600
