539
00:30:45,050 --> 00:30:48,390
an important treatment to
prevent kidney stones is

540
00:30:48,390 --> 00:30:53,410
going to be a low salt diet
remember we want low salt diet

541
00:30:53,410 --> 00:30:57,110
but we do not want a low
calcium diet because low

542
00:30:57,110 --> 00:31:00,930
